{"id":"wb-1-78","name":"赵州陀罗尼经幢","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"赵州陀罗尼经幢","text":"赵州陀罗尼经幢位于中华人民共和国河北省石家庄市赵县城内南大街（石桥大街）与石塔路交汇处，是一座北宋时期建造的经幢。该经幢通高16.44米，是中华人民共和国境内现存最高大的经幢。其曾于明朝隆庆年间加以整修，1961年，赵州陀罗尼经幢被列为全国重点文物保护单位。1984年因雷击而严重损毁，1990年修复完毕。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B5%B5%E5%B7%9E%E9%99%80%E7%BD%97%E5%B0%BC%E7%BB%8F%E5%B9%A2","revisionId":89424153,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89424153","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9d7da43221dffa1b4b4e4eb5.jpg","title":"Sutra_Pillar_of_the_Song_Dynasty_in_Zhaozhou_07_2011-07.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sutra_Pillar_of_the_Song_Dynasty_in_Zhaozhou_07_2011-07.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/97/Sutra_Pillar_of_the_Song_Dynasty_in_Zhaozhou_07_2011-07.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​赵州陀罗尼经幢，南面。","width":320,"height":427}}